      <title>Proposed bill amendment would preempt local control of GRU</title>
      <link>https://www.wuft.org/heard-on-wuft-fm/2026-02-27/proposed-bill-amendment-would-preempt-local-control-of-gru</link>
      <description>A Florida House committee has advanced a bill that includes an amendment that would give the state control over city municipal utilities created after Jan. 1, 2023. If passed, House Bill 1451 would effectively overturn local votes to retain control of Gainesville Regional Utilities.</description>
